-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:22b55480bab060cee55923cf052ac59ad7bbb935b53a5ba550067b37e5f39cf0","file":"preprints/A-sharp-entropy-bound-and-the-simplex-inequality-for-isotropic-constants-October-5-2026/build/manuscript/introduction.tex","line":75,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"388a9b7234e85b3b7733a0968297d89a56868c5ae4e1428171f3d04ea9f60c08","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/A-sharp-entropy-bound-and-the-simplex-inequality-for-isotropic-constants-October-5-2026/build/manuscript/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:22b55480bab060cee55923cf052ac59ad7bbb935b53a5ba550067b37e5f39cf0","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-sharp-entropy-bound-and-the-simplex-inequality-for-isotropic-constants-October-5-2026/build/manuscript/introduction.tex#L75"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{intro:entropy}\nLet $m\\ge1$ and let $f$ be a log-concave probability density on $\\R^m$.\nThen\n\\begin{equation}\\label{intro:entropy-bound}\n h(f)\\ge m+\\frac12\\log\\det\\Cov(f).\n\\end{equation}\nEquality holds if and only if $f$ is, almost everywhere, the density\nof $M(E_1,\\ldots,E_m)^{\\mathsf T}+b$, where $M$ is an invertible real\n$m\\times m$ matrix, $b\\in\\R^m$, and the $E_i$ are independent random\nvariables with density $e^{-u}\\mathbf1_{\\{u\\ge0\\}}$."}
